  "keys": "labels[card_id][axis id][value id]: the card's options.axes[].id and options.axes[].values[].id, i.e. the same keys a SKU's `values` carries (build-catalog.ts: valueOf(a, s) = a.values.find(v => v.id === s.values[a.id])). The Hebrew replaces that value's label_he.",
