    "copied": "a label that was already correct Hebrew is copied verbatim, including its quote marks (ס\"מ or ס״מ as in the card)",
    "sizes": "centimetres with ×; inches and millimetres converted to cm",
    "codes": "supplier letter codes become Hebrew letters in order (A=א׳ … I=ט׳, J=י׳, K=כ׳, L=ל׳, M=מ׳, N=נ׳, O=ס׳, P=ע׳, Q=פ׳, R=צ׳, S=ק׳, T=ר׳); plain index numbers stay digits ('הדפס 2', 'דגם 7'); supplier model numbers (TL2356, 2345, 2437, 2443) and brand names are dropped",
    "units": "3000K / 4000K / 6000K kept as a neutral light unit, like ס\"מ"
  },
